      "mechanism": "js paginationTotal() pattern (background.ts PRE_RUN_DOMQUERY) reading the Vuetify data-table footer '1-N of TOTAL' on /organization/people. Superseded an earlier tableRowCount(<tr> count) attempt in this same pass, which breaks once the org has more people than one page.",
      "primaryVerification": "confirmation_message contains 'success'/'created'/'added'/'onboard' OR redirect to /workflows/ OR /organization/people, AND final_active_people == initial_active_people + 1"
    },
    "lastDurationMs": 3964
  },
